    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 28,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring and knowledgeable veterinary team"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners consistently highlight the warmth, empathy, and expertise of the veterinary surgeons and clinical nurses, especially Dr Jose. Clients describe a team that listens attentively to owner concerns and creates a reassuring environment during stressful visits. While a couple of reviewers felt reception interactions lacked tact, the broad consensus praises the clinicians for dedicated and skilled patient care."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 16,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling for dogs and cats"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers emphasize how patiently domestic pets are treated during examinations, surgical procedures, and routine wellness checks. Clients with anxious dogs and elderly cats note that the practitioners take unhurried time to settle animals calmly before starting treatment. Pet parents repeatedly remark on the genuine affection and consideration demonstrated towards their four-legged companions."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Successful treatments and surgical recoveries"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report positive clinical outcomes across a range of procedures, including emergency extractions, kitten neutering, and ongoing care for senior cats with chronic illness. Pet owners appreciate thorough diagnostic assessments and clear post-operative instructions. Although one owner felt intermediate diagnostic options were skipped, most clients express strong trust in the treatment results."
      }
    }
  ],
